    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35389" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">perpōtātĭo</span></b> ,
			ōnis, f.
		perpoto, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a continued drinking</i>, <i>a
				drinking-bout</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">biduo duabusque noctibus perpotationem
					continuare,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					14, 22, 28, § 145</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">intemperantissimae perpotationes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Pis. 10, 22</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vomitiones ac rursus perpotationes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					29, 1, 8, § 27</span></i>
			.</div>
